---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Your book" description="Your private book, reusable agent skill, and source references." path="/your-book/" robots="noindex, nofollow">
 <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16" data-private-book>
  <a href="/books/" class="text-sm underline">← Your books</a>
  <header class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_180px]">
   <div><p class="awb-eyebrow">Your book &amp; skill</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-4xl" data-job-title>Loading your book…</h1><p class="mt-3 text-soft" data-job-author></p></div>
   <img hidden data-job-cover alt="Generated book cover" class="w-44 rounded-xl" />
  </header>
  <section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-line p-5" aria-label="Processing progress"><p role="status" data-job-status>Checking your saved progress…</p><progress class="mt-4 w-full" data-job-progress max="100" value="0"></progress><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-soft" data-job-resume>Your upload is saved. Processing continues in the background; you can return to this link any time.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button hidden class="awb-pill" data-job-retry>Resume processing</button><button hidden class="awb-pill" data-job-pause>Pause</button><a href="/processing/" class="awb-pill">View queue</a></div></section>
  <section hidden class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6" data-job-analysis>
   <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl">Your source analysis</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-soft">Review these source-grounded notes. Creating the book and skill reuses this analysis.</p>
   <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button class="awb-pill awb-pill-primary" data-job-generate>Create book &amp; skill</button><button class="awb-pill" data-job-analysis-download>Download analysis</button></div>
   <div class="mt-6 space-y-6" data-job-analysis-notes></div>
  </section>
  <section hidden class="mt-8" data-job-content>
   <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-soft" data-job-quality hidden></p>
   <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button class="awb-pill awb-pill-primary" data-job-copy disabled>Copy prompt for your AI</button><button class="awb-pill" data-job-download disabled>Download book &amp; skill</button><a class="awb-pill" data-job-source>Original book</a><button class="awb-pill" data-job-previous hidden>Download previous version</button></div>
   <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-soft" role="status" data-job-copy-status>Copies your book notes and skill instructions as a prompt. Paste it into your AI chat, add your task, and send. Download the package to install a reusable skill in your agent.</p>
   <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-soft" role="status" data-job-audit></p><button hidden class="awb-pill mt-3" data-job-audit-retry>Retry skill check</button>
   <div hidden class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-line p-4" data-job-review><p class="text-sm">The upstream scanner flagged these passages. Review them in context before using the skill.</p><pre class="mt-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-xs" data-job-findings></pre><label class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-1" data-job-review-accept />I reviewed these passages and accept this skill for my use.</label></div>
   <textarea hidden readonly rows="10" class="awb-input mt-3 w-full" aria-label="Book agent prompt" data-job-prompt></textarea>
   <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 sm:p-8" data-job-reading></div>
   <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-soft">AI-generated draft. Check important claims against your original book. Source section references describe extraction ranges, not verified original chapter boundaries.</p>
  </section>
 </article>
 <script>import '../../lib/private-book';</script>
 <style>progress{accent-color:var(--color-ink);height:6px;border:0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}progress::-webkit-progress-bar{background:var(--color-line)}progress::-webkit-progress-value{background:var(--color-ink)}</style>
</Base>
